t="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224"><source media="(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224"><source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224"><source media="(max-width: 767px) and (orientation: portrait)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224 1x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda_850x850.png?v=1586297224 2x"><source media="(max-width: 767px) and (orientation: landscape)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224 1x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224 2x"><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-575bac80--honda.png?v=1586297224" alt="Honda partner logo" title="Honda partner logo"></picture></div></div></div></div></div><div data-container="true" class="sc-pZopv bjKdkd pf-26393dbd" id="product-overview" data-pf-type="Section"><div class="sc-pQQXS iWCqut" style="max-width: 1170px;"><div class="sc-qPjXN eYzxUD pf-44fe06a2 pf-r pf-r-eh" data-pf-type="Row" style="--pf-s-lg:15px; --pf-s-md:15px; --pf-s-sm:15px; --pf-s-xs:15px;"><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--12 pf-c-md--12 pf-c-lg--12"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-254475bc" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-scrolltop="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion2" class="sc-pkfPC GftoS pf-0750e84e"><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-e17a11ab accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-638cead1 pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="8123a274-87c1-4ed3-b8ac-3152de25e58b" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="true" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="icon_position accordion__arrow fa fa-chevron-right"></i>Product Overview</button><div class="sc-qYUWV exYsxy pf-994f67bc accordion__content" mode="view" data-id="8123a274-87c1-4ed3-b8ac-3152de25e58b" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content" style="display: block;"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-qQKeD NKnmf pf-2b9fb158"><div><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-0733396c">Product Overview</span></div></div><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-5de4c5af"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-92bf80d1"><span style="color: rgb(47, 54, 64);"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Maximize your Visibility with an Impact Canopy<br></span>How can you make every public appearance count? With custom and innovative canopies that make your presence known. Branded canopies capture the attention of those passing by, as well as foot traffic from far away, thanks to custom logo printing and color combinations. They deliver your message quickly and are the perfect way to promote your brand. Great for indoor and outdoor events including:<br></span><br></span></p><ul data-pf-type="List" class="sc-pcLhl bMMcvF pf-99302a4f" style="--text-indent:0; --line-spacing:10px;"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-4d67b16f"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-93e7d9bb">Trade Show Displays<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-5ce4589e"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-e473d6fe">In-store promotions<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-2341bdf6"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-ee83307b">Farmers Market<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-6300ab0d"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-24b6d062">Festivals<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-c8db9aa2"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-22f67716">Parties<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-8927c48c"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-6536402c">Team sporting events<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-2624846b"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-20ed7eea">Corporate Events<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-4c62d12c"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-31e995b8">Registration Booths<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-1aa5d3ed"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-3c225012">Demo Days<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-449feb92"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-5ec0855e">and more!<br></span></li></ul><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-54eb6204"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-e7d1379f">The foundation of any good canopy is a frame. Not only are our frames strong, sturdy and durable, they’re also lightweight and easy to assemble. They’re the first thing you need to consider when picking the perfect canopy. The options for frames range by sizes and materials. You can learn more about our frames here.<br><br>Once you have decided on a frame, we can start getting creative with a top. Impact’s Instant Canopies are equipped with a premium 500 denier polyester top that is water, mildew and rot resistant and meets ULCS 109, CPAI 84 and NFPA 701 Fire codes. The great thing about custom printed canopies is that they are specifically designed with your needs in mind. Digitally printed products from Impact Canopy can be matched to virtually any Pantone solid-coated color. No matter what color you use in your branding, Impact Canopy will be able to match it – or find a close alternative with more cost-effective choices depending on your needs.<br></span></p></div></div><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-77ff5f28 accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-6f47c3c1 pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="0a7066a2-3a41-4680-82a7-a267a17d5625" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="icon_position accordion__arrow fa fa-chevron-right"></i>Product Specs</button><div class="sc-qYUWV exYsxy pf-a3b34cbb accordion__content" mode="view" data-id="0a7066a2-3a41-4680-82a7-a267a17d5625" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content" style="display: none;"><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-2c554bb1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-ec71eeb5">Impact canopy offers a variety of frames to fit every need. Not sure which frame is right for you? Contact us and we will be happy to assist you in getting the perfect canopy! Here are some more details on our most popular frames:<br><br>DS Steel Frame: This frame is a lightweight powder coated steel frame with plastic fittings. The foot pads are nylon fiberglass that are reinforced with steel. The DS Frame is also available in black and it comes in sizes 5′ x 5′, 8′ x 8′, 8′ x 12′, and 10′ x 10′. See the DS Frame specs here.<br><br>CL Steel frame: This Frame is our heavy duty industrial steel frame with nylon fittings and steel foot pads. The CL Frame is also available in black and it comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20′. See the CL Frame specs here.<br><br>10×10 ML Aluminum Frame: This frame is our lightest frame made with industrial aluminum. It includes reinforced cross bars, double sided brackets and is rust resistant. It comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20′. See the ML Frame specs here.<br><br>10×10 M Aluminum Frame: This frame is our heavy duty, aircraft grade aluminum frame. It includes similar features to our ML frame, but is thicker making it one of our most durable frames. It comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20‘. See the M Frame specs here.<br><br>MegaX Aluminum Frame: This frame is our most durable commercial grade aluminum frame. With an anodized aluminum brush finish and and nylon fiberglass connectors, it is unmatched in the instant canopy industry. The MegaX offers a wide variety of sizes including 10′ x 10′, 13′ x 20′, 13′ x 26′, 16′ x 16′, and 20′ x 20′. See the MegaX specs here.<br><br>All of our tops are Water Repellent & UV Coated and meet ULC-S109, CPAI-84 and NFPA 701 Fire Resistant Requirements</span></p><div class="sc-qPjXN eYzxUD pf-6a9e7495 pf-r pf-r-eh" data-pf-type="Row" style="--pf-s-lg:15px; --pf-s-md:15px; --pf-s-sm:15px; --pf-s-xs:15px;"><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--6 pf-c-md--6 pf-c-lg--6"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-98164e20" data-pf-type="Column"><a data-action="lightbox" href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-6b9da99d--10048Frame-Details-MLIMGUSAR101-1.jpg?v=1583860900" data-pf-type="Image2" class="sc-pzLqt jakOsZ pf-aa669285"><img sizes="(min-width: 992px) 1200px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px) 800px, 400px" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-6b9da99d--10048Frame-Details-MLIMGUSAR101-1.jpg?v=1583860900 1200w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-6b9da99d--10048Frame-Details-MLIMGUSAR101-1_800x478.jpg?v=1583860900&resized 800w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-6b9da99d--10048Frame-Details-MLIMGUSAR101-1_400x239.jpg?v=1583860900&re